{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50011","headline":"罢官後却归旧居 · 陈闰","name":"罢官後却归旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不归江畔久，旧业已凋残。\n露草虫丝湿，湖泥鸟迹乾。\n买山开客舍，选竹作渔竿。\n何必劳州县，驱驰効一官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈闰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}